<title>UK: Spintab sets $400 million five-year Eurobond.</title>
<headline>Spintab sets $400 million five-year Eurobond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager HSBC Markets.</p>
<p> BORROWER   SPINTAB</p>
<p> AMT	  $400 MLN  COUPON     **	  MATURITY    04.MAR.02</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  **	  PAY DATE    04.MAR.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.875     REOFFER    **	  SPREAD	+30 BP</p>
<p> NOTES    **TO BE PRICED LATER.</p>
<p> MOODY	=	   LISTING    LONDON/HK PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  =	   DENOMS (K) 1-10-100  SALE LIMS US/GB/SE/HK</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   IPMA 2</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   HOME CTRY  SWEDEN    TAX PROVS   STANDARD</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.275     SELL CONC  1.60	PRAECIPUUM  NONE</p>
<p>UNDERLYING GOVT BOND 6.25 PCT U.S. TREASURY NOTE DUE 31.JAN.02 -- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
